Object.assign(AUDIO_BY_TEXT, {"Good morning, everyone, and welcome to the Green Tourism Seminar here in beautiful Da Nang!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","It is wonderful to see two hundred delegates gathered here to talk about the future of travel.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Today we will explore how tourism can grow while protecting the nature we all love.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Da Nang is the perfect place for this conversation, with its green mountains and its blue sea.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and I am honored to guide you through this morning's program.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Our first speaker is Doctor Pham Quoc Huy, a leading expert in sustainable tourism.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Doctor Huy has spent twenty years helping coastal cities grow greener and smarter.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please join me in welcoming Doctor Huy to the stage with a warm round of applause.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Later this morning, we will also hear from Ms Lan Anh, director of the Green Coast Project.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Each speaker brings real stories from the field, so please listen closely and take notes.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Now, let us begin with our first presentation: Green Routes for the Central Coast.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Doctor Huy will show us how small changes can make a big difference for local communities.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","After the talk, we will have fifteen minutes for your questions, so please prepare them.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","If you have a question, please raise your hand, and our team will bring you a microphone.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Let us give Doctor Huy our full attention as we open this important discussion.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","We have learned so much today, from green routes to community projects that truly work.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please join me in thanking Doctor Huy, Ms Lan Anh, and all our speakers once again.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you to every delegate who shared a question, an idea, or simply your time.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Let us carry these ideas home and turn them into action for a greener Da Nang.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","I wish you all a safe journey home, and I hope to see you at our next seminar.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good morning, ladies and gentlemen, and welcome to the Da Nang Tourism Festival 2026!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","It is such a joy to see so many smiling faces here at Asia Park this beautiful morning.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and I am honored to be your host for today's opening ceremony.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Da Nang is a city of sunshine, rivers, and warm hospitality, and today we celebrate it all.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Before we begin, please give a warm round of applause for this wonderful festival!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Today's program is full of color, music, and the very best of Da Nang's culture.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","You will enjoy traditional dances, street food, and live performances from local artists.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Our tourism booths will show you the beaches, the mountains, and the hidden gems of our city.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Families can join games, take photos, and discover travel offers made just for this festival.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","So stay with us all morning, because every moment today has something special for you.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, please welcome to the stage the Sun Dance Troupe with their opening performance!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Their dance tells the story of fishermen greeting the sunrise over the Han River.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Let's give them a big hand as the music begins!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","What a beautiful start! Thank you, Sun Dance Troupe, for that wonderful energy!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, I would like to invite our leaders to the stage to officially open the festival.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","The festival is now officially open — let the celebration begin!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you all for being here and for your love for Da Nang tourism.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please enjoy the food, the music, and the friendly people of our city today.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Take many photos, share your joy, and make beautiful memories with your family.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Have a wonderful festival day, and see you again at our next event in Da Nang!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good morning, ladies and gentlemen, and welcome to the groundbreaking ceremony of the Song Han Riverside Urban Area!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","It is a great honor to stand here with you on this beautiful morning by the Han River.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Today, we take the first step in building a new riverside community for the people of Da Nang.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and I am delighted to be your host for this special morning.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please join me in a warm round of applause as we begin this meaningful ceremony.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","The Song Han Riverside project covers more than thirty hectares along the east bank of the Han River.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","When it is complete, it will be home to thousands of families, with parks, schools, and shops.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","The project will be built in three stages over the next five years, starting with the roads and the river park.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","It is designed as a green urban area, with trees, open spaces, and clean energy for every home.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","This is more than a construction project — it is a promise of a better life by the river.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, the moment we have all been waiting for — the groundbreaking!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","May I invite our city leaders, our investors, and our chief engineers to please come to the stage.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Ladies and gentlemen, please take your shovels and stand ready at the sand table.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Let us count down together: five, four, three, two, one — break the ground!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","What a wonderful moment! Please give our leaders a big round of applause for the first shovels of earth!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","The first shovels are in the ground, and the future of Song Han Riverside has officially begun.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you to our city leaders, our investors, and our engineers for your trust and your vision.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you to every guest who joined us this morning to share this historic moment.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","We wish the project smooth construction, great success, and a bright future for all who will live here.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Goodbye for now, and we look forward to welcoming you back when the first buildings rise by the river.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"});
